  <p>BoomBoom5 is a P-pop all-cape boy band and hero team based in the Fort.</p>

  <h2>Members</h2>
  <h3>Brightstar</h3>
  <p>Brightstar is the leader of BoomBoom5 and the lead singer of the band. His costume is white and pastel yellow,
  matching his on-stage aesthetic.</p>
  <p>Brightstar has the ability to fly and shoot explosive firework-like blasts from his hands.</p>
  </p>
  <h3>Rosebud</h3>
  <p>Rosebud's costume is pink and green. He is able to cause vines to grow in his surroundings which sprout pink
  flower buds.</p>
  <h3>DahanDahan</h3>
  <p>DahanDahan can make himself and others move in slow motion. His costume is sky blue. He and MabilisBilis are
  twins.</p>
  <h3>MabilisBilis</h3>
  <p>MabilisBilis can make himself and others move in fast-forward. His costume is light orange.</p>
</ParahumanWikiLayout>